      "source_file": "icrs/202606-1652-002/raw/supporting-statement-a-1.txt",
      "preceding_text": "New HME enrollees and renewals are charged a standard fee of $85.25 in a TSA Agent State.  TSA estimates on average, HME enrollees and renewals are charged a fee of $91.86 in TSA Non-Agent States.  TSA calculates the cost of the fee by multiplying the number of HME enrollments in TSA Agent and TSA Non-Agent States by their respective enrollment fee.  TSA calculates fees from TSA Agent States to be $21.2 million (enrollments) + $20.8 (renewal) million = $42 million over 3 years ($14 million annually), fees from TSA Non-Agent States to be $18.1 million over 3 years ($6 million annually) for a total of $60.1 million over 3 years ($20 million).  Table 11 summarizes these calculations.",
